{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>警方今日（8日）在荃灣掃黃，打擊街頭賣淫活動，行動中，在沙嘴道一個單位內拘捕一名50歲的內地女子，涉嫌「為不道德目的而唆使他人」及「違反逗留條件」。案件明日（9日）在西九龍裁判法院提堂。</p>\n<p>警員亦在該單位內檢獲一批證物，包括大量避孕套及紙巾等。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.634360+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T09:38:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:26.117636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.600514+00:00","content_hash":"377392ea92f288c9017052cf7b11a944ceae7176c5b5fbef24e4574d29789c9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}